{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SWEYET</h2>Explore a series of diverse, mechanically driven dreamscapes. <strong>SWEYET<i>(etc.)</i></strong> is a single player  <i>(always)</i>, first person <i>(generally)</i>, game <i>(mostly)</i>. <strong>SWEYET</strong> uses <i><u>optional</u></i> eye tracking technology utilizing your everyday webcam. Through the physical action of real-life blinking, the world changes around you, drawing inspiration from the unpredictable nature of the films that play in our heads between each day.<br><br><br>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063200/extras/269e6fc8deca4a60cd1b6128997a270e.poster.avif?t=1755554222\" width=480 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063200/extras/269e6fc8deca4a60cd1b6128997a270e.webm?t=1755554222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063200/extras/269e6fc8deca4a60cd1b6128997a270e.mp4?t=1755554222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE FAMILIAR DISCOMFORT</h2>Dreamscapes are connected, with your path branching based on the outcome of each world. The puzzles within opt for a new approach, typically obscuring controls, forcing one to think outside the box and confront their relationship with gaming and their expectation of &quot;control&quot;. <br><br><br>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063200/extras/2bbe7794f520acb832c99a4bb1dbc1d8.poster.avif?t=1755554222\" width=480 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063200/extras/2bbe7794f520acb832c99a4bb1dbc1d8.webm?t=1755554222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063200/extras/2bbe7794f520acb832c99a4bb1dbc1d8.mp4?t=1755554222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE UNPREDICTABLE</h2>Meet and help the unique characters that occupy these worlds to discover the connections that lay beneath. Help them, and maybe they will help you...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THANKS FOR READING, HOPE TO SEE YOU SOON!</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063200/extras/fb75b72c3476e50f0c2abd2ea3d12144.poster.avif?t=1755554222\" width=618 height=464 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063200/extras/fb75b72c3476e50f0c2abd2ea3d12144.webm?t=1755554222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063200/extras/fb75b72c3476e50f0c2abd2ea3d12144.mp4?t=1755554222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3063200?t=1755554222","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063200/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755554222","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063200/f4f4436bf13db258c1066304761a00648e3b109b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755554222","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063200/f4f4436bf13db258c1066304761a00648e3b109b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755554222","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"not